@startuml
title State machine for Staff Member Class

state Unassigned
state Assigned
state Switching

[*] --> Unassigned : /initialize

Unassigned --> Assigned : assignToClientOrCampaign

Assigned --> Unassigned : removeAssignment

Assigned --> Switching : switchAssignments

Switching --> Assigned : completeSwitch

Unassigned --> Archived : markUnemployed

Archived --> [*] :

@enduml
